{"title":"Antlion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 19 Antlion that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/antlion\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=19\">Lv 19</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 16 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"antlion-mandible\" title=\"Antlion Mandible - in 69% of 16 looted corpses, 11 recorded drops, 14 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3af9398e31b21e1c0d76.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Mandible</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">69% · 11/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"chitin-plate\" title=\"Chitin Plate - in 63% of 16 looted corpses, 10 recorded drops, 18 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Chitin Plate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">63% · 10/16</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-feet\" title=\"Snakeskin Feet - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/efd965c50ca047cf9803.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-shield\" title=\"Silver Shield (weasel x1) - in 6% of 16 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/cc36211c4f2a44a45d5a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Shield</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6% · 1/16</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Antlion Hive</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 10</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-182\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Antlion: <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling\">Antlion Pitling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior\">Antlion Warrior</a> <span class=\"muted\">(23)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-queen\">Antlion Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/4017ffba1a6145bf0e94.webp\" alt=\"Antlion\"></div><h3>Antlion</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>19 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 20–22)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Antlion</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>61</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>15</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>950</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}